4775 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Originally\054 this was a friendship bracelet pattern meant to be knotted with threads\056 I altered the pattern for beading\054 and my wife chose the seed bead colors\056 We are happy to share these updates as well\072\nTo fit smaller wrists\054 seven rows were removed from various areas\056\nStretched vertically by 1\0562x to adjust for the bead aspect ratio\056\nThe moon was redrawn to maintain its 1\0721 circular ratio after the stretch\056\nThe bubble color was replaced with white \050looks much better in beads\051\056\nGeneral permission for posting this kind of modifications\072      )
     /K [ 18 ]
     /P 4778 0 R
     /Pg 2492 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
