  << /ActualText (This is one of my earliest bracelets\054 and both my wife and I have made remakes of it over the years\056 In total\054 we\031ve tried three color palettes across three different lineups of finishes\056 We were never fully satisfied with our initial choices in each lineup\054 so there are no relevant photo of the bracelets\056\nHowever\054 if I were to make another one today\054 I\031d use one of the updated sets below\054 which are based on our past experience\056 These are my wife\047s picks \024 she is officially our color manager\056\nFeel free to message      )
